asus-zenbook-linux-tools (1.0.7) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Added SonarQube Cloud analysis to CI, fed by the pipeline's own Python and
    shell coverage (new kcov Cobertura to Sonar generic coverage converter).
  * Fixed findings the analysis surfaced in product code: monitor scale is now
    compared with math.isclose instead of float equality in the GNOME window
    swap helper, the touchpad read loop logs a traceback, redundant exception
    classes and duplicated literals were cleaned up, and two regular
    expressions no longer backtrack super-linearly.
