asus-zenbook-linux-tools (1.0.6) resolute; urgency=medium

  * ScreenPad brightness now survives reboot: the hotkey daemon unit runs
    asus-screenpad-brightness.sh restore (ExecStartPre) ordered after
    systemd-backlight@, which saved the powered-off panel as 0 and clamped it
    to a dim floor at boot. Restore prefers the session user's persisted level
    and falls back to the newest per-user state file when no session exists.
  * Dev tooling bumps: coverage 7.16.1, pylint 4.0.8, ruff 0.16.8,
    eslint 10.11.0.

